---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
description: Get in touch with 406 Front Desk in Kalispell, Montana. Book a demo, ask a question, or claim a founding-client spot.
pageCss: contact
permalink: /contact/
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
<div class="header-band">
    <span class="header-eyebrow">Contact</span>
    <h1>Let's talk</h1>
    <p>Questions about setup, pricing, or how it works? Reach out — we'd love to help.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid">

      <p class="intro-line">Get in touch with 406 Front Desk in Kalispell, Montana.</p>

      <!-- CALL — main line -->
      <a href="tel:+14068400404" class="ccard" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
        <div class="ccard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          {{ icon("phone") }}
        </div>
        <div class="ccard-label">Call or Text</div>
        <div class="ccard-value"><span class="nowrap">(406) 840-0404</span></div>
        <div class="ccard-sub">Our AI receptionist answers calls live 24/7 and texts back every missed call. Prefer email or chat? Both are right here.</div>
      </a>

      <!-- EMAIL -->
      <a href="mailto:admin@406frontdesk.com" class="ccard">
        <div class="ccard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          {{ icon("mail") }}
        </div>
        <div class="ccard-label">Email</div>
        <div class="ccard-value"><span class="nowrap">admin@406frontdesk.com</span></div>
        <div class="ccard-sub">We usually reply the same day.</div>
      </a>

      <!-- LOCATION -->
      <div class="ccard" style="cursor:default;">
        <div class="ccard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          {{ icon("map-pin") }}
        </div>
        <div class="ccard-label">Location</div>
        <div class="ccard-value">Kalispell, Montana</div>
        <div class="ccard-sub">Proudly serving the Flathead Valley — and businesses anywhere in the U.S.</div>
      </div>

      <!-- DEMO -->
      <a href="/demo/" class="ccard" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
        <div class="ccard-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          {{ icon("lock") }}
        </div>
        <div class="ccard-label">Try it first</div>
        <div class="ccard-value">See the demo</div>
        <div class="ccard-sub">Experience the AI receptionist yourself.</div>
      </a>

      <!-- AVAILABILITY -->
      <div class="avail">
        <div class="avail-pulse"><div class="avail-dot"></div></div>
        <div class="avail-text">
          <h2>Available 24/7</h2>
          <p>Our AI receptionist never sleeps — reach us any time, day or night.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

